OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain clears
OL,6,Fmuch of England and Wales this
OL,7,Fevening, followed by clear spells and
OL,8,Fa few showers. Frequent showers
OL,9,Fpersist across Scotland and Northern
OL,10,FIreland as winds strengthen further,
OL,11,Fbringing the risk of some damaging
OL,12,Fgusts of wind in places.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,15,Frain continue for Scotland and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland, with winds only
OL,17,Fslowly easing. Drier and brighter
OL,18,Felsewhere, with blustery showers in
OL,19,Fthe north and west.
